  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/torch-hit/banner.gif\" alt=\"火把命中！横幅\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/minecraft.svg\" alt=\"Minecraft\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/torch-hit/files?version=26.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/26-1-x.svg\" alt=\"26.1.x\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔符\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/torch-hit/files?version=1.21.11\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-11.svg\" alt=\"1.21.11\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔符\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/torch-hit/files?version=1.21.10\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-10.svg\" alt=\"1.21.10\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔符\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/torch-hit/files?version=1.21.8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-8.svg\" alt=\"1.21.8\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔符\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/torch-hit/files?version=1.21.7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-7.svg\" alt=\"1.21.7\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔符\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/torch-hit/files?version=1.21.6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-6.svg\" alt=\"1.21.6\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔符\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/torch-hit/files?version=1.21.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-1.svg\" alt=\"1.21.1\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔符\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/torch-hit/files?version=1.21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21.svg\" alt=\"1.21\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔符\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/loader/loader.svg\" alt=\"加载器\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/torch-hit/files?gameVersionTypeId=6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/loader/neoforge.svg\" alt=\"NeoForge\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔符\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/torch-hit/files?gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/loader/fabric.svg\" alt=\"Fabric\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/side/server.svg\" alt=\"覆盖层\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/github/issues.svg\" alt=\"问题\"><a href=\"https://github.com/crystal-nest/torch-hit/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/github/github.svg\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>📝 <strong>描述</strong></h2>\n<p>探索洞穴时，你面临着一个选择：在主手拿着火把照亮周围，还是拿着盾牌抵御怪物。<br>\n有了这个模组，你不再需要做出选择了！火把将赋予你战斗优势！<br>\n手持火把时，你可以点燃敌人，从而让探索更轻松，或者作为“火焰附加”的早期游戏替代品。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraftstorage.com%252fmods%252ftorch-hit%253fref%253dcrystal-nest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/torch-hit/minecraft-storage-banner.png\" alt=\"Minecraft Storage\"></a></p>\n<h2>⚙️ <strong>兼容性</strong></h2>\n<p>兼容 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/soul-fire-d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Soul Fire'd</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/copper-fire\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Copper Fire</a> 以及任何模组添加的火把！<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/torch-hit/soul-hit.gif\" alt=\"灵魂命中\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/torch-hit/mod-hit.gif\" alt=\"模组命中\"><br>\n此外，如果模组火把与 <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/prometheus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Prometheus</a></strong> 兼容，使用它攻击时将施加相应类型的火焰伤害！</p>\n<h2>✨ <strong>特性</strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>在主手中持火把攻击，造成火焰伤害！<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/torch-hit/hit.gif\" alt=\"命中\"></li>\n<li>在主手中持工具，副手持火把，攻击时造成火焰伤害！<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/torch-hit/tool-hit.gif\" alt=\"工具命中\"></li>\n<li>如果安装了 <strong>Soul Fire'd</strong>，灵魂火把会将生物点燃为灵魂之火！<br>\n如果未安装，灵魂火把会点燃猪灵双倍时间的火焰，并点燃其他实体额外 2 秒！</li>\n<li>如果安装了 <strong>Copper Fire</strong>，铜火把会将生物点燃为铜火！<br>\n如果未安装，铜火把会点燃铜傀儡双倍时间的火焰，并点燃其他实体额外 1 秒！</li>\n<li><strong>高度可配置！</strong> 详见下一节。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><strong>配置</strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>默认情况下，直接（主手）火把攻击会造成持续 4 秒的火焰伤害，等同于火焰附魔 I。<br>\n持续时间可以进行配置。</li>\n<li>默认情况下，间接（副手）火把攻击已启用，适用于任何工具，造成持续 2 秒的火焰伤害。<br>\n持续时间、工具列表、对木制工具的耐久消耗，以及是否启用此功能均可配置。</li>\n<li>可以将新物品设置为 behave as 火把，默认包含最常见的模组火把列表。</li>\n<li>默认情况下，蜡烛也充当火把！但是，它们在被用于攻击时会损坏。<br>\n蜡烛在使用时是否会损坏，以及是否完全启用此功能，均可配置。</li>\n<li>默认情况下，火把和蜡烛总是点燃目标，且只有蜡烛会在使用后损坏。<br>\n火把是否也会损坏、点燃目标的概率，以及物品损坏选项均可配置。</li>\n<li>默认情况下，原版火把可用于造成火焰伤害。<br>\n如果你希望调整游戏平衡，可以防止原版火把造成火焰伤害，仅允许配置中的额外物品生效。</li>\n<li>默认情况下，手持火把的生物可以点燃其他实体（包括玩家）。<br>\n此选项可以禁用。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>🔗 <strong>依赖项</strong></h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">模组</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\">加载器</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\">要求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobweb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cobweb</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">所有</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">必需</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge Config API Port</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">Fabric</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">必需</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/soul-fire-d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Soul Fire'd</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">所有</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">可选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/copper-fire\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Copper Fire</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">所有</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">可选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/prometheus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Prometheus</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">所有</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">可选</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>📜 <strong>许可证与使用权</strong></h2>\n<p>你可以自由地将此模组用于任何模组包或视频中，只需确保署名并可能链接 <a href=\"https://github.com/crystal-nest/torch-hit#readme\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>。<br>\n本项目依据 <a href=\"https://github.com/crystal-nest/torch-hit/blob/master/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Crystal Nest Community License v1</a> 发布。</p>\n<h2>❤️ <strong>支持我们</strong></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrystalnest.it%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Crystal Nest Website\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/crystal-nest/pic512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/BP6EdBfAmt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/discord/discord512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/crystalspider\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Patreon\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/patreon/patreon512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fcrystalspider\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Ko-fi\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/kofi/kofi512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><img alt=\"Our other projects\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/github/github512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252fcrystal-nest\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Modrinth\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/modrinth/modrinth512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/crystalspider/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"CurseForge\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/curseforge/curseforge512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fcrystalspider\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/d559b544-474c-4109-b861-1b2e6ca6026a.webp\" alt=\"Bisect Hosting\"></a></p></p>",
